{
  "_about": "Cases the app's food search (test/search_rules_shared_test.dart) and the recipe matcher (blobb-recipe-worker, test_search_rules_shared.py) must both pass, so their ranking rules can't drift apart. Each repo keeps a copy (blobb-app test/search_rank_cases.json, blobb-recipe-worker search_rank_cases.json); a test on each side fails while they differ. A candidate's display_name defaults to its description, data_type to 'SR Legacy', kcal to 100.",

